  "body": "There are homes that impress, and there are homes that make you exhale.\r\n\r\nHidden behind a private gate, this extraordinary residence transports you to a secluded Balinese-inspired sanctuary where the outside world simply disappears. \r\nA tranquil lily pond, lush tropical gardens and the gentle sound of flowing water create an immediate sense of calm-a home that soothes the senses from the very first step.\r\nDesigned for effortless indoor-outdoor living, warm timber floors lead you through beautifully connected living spaces where a designer kitchen, family room and dining area spill seamlessly onto expansive entertaining decks. \r\n\r\nThe sunken lounge, complete with a gas fireplace, offers a welcoming retreat in every season, while the outdoor fireplace extends long evenings beneath the stars.\r\nThe gardens are nothing short of spectacular.\r\nCreated by acclaimed landscape designer Matt McIsaac, the grounds are a masterpiece of texture, water and greenery. \r\n\r\nA gently flowing rill winds through tropical planting to a stunning Japanese-inspired pavilion-the perfect setting for entertaining, quiet reflection or morning coffee. \r\nNearby, a private spa nestles amongst the lush landscape, completing a setting that feels more boutique resort than suburban home.\r\n\r\nPredominantly arranged on one level, the home has been thoughtfully designed for family living. \r\nFour generous bedrooms, a dedicated office and beautifully appointed family bathroom provide exceptional comfort, while the privately positioned master suite enjoys its own dressing room, walk-in wardrobe and ensuite.\r\n\r\nA fully self-contained guest wing occupies the lower level, offering a fifth bedroom, bathroom, living area and kitchenette with its own entrance-ideal for extended family, guests, teenagers or independent living.\r\n\r\nThe generous rear lawn provides plenty of space for children and pets to play, with room to add a swimming pool should you wish.\r\n\r\nPracticality has not been overlooked, with a separate laundry, oversized internal-access double garage and abundant storage complementing the home's exceptional liveability.\r\nPeaceful, private and securely tucked away, yet just moments from Kohimarama Beach, local cafés and everyday amenities, this is a home that feels worlds away while remaining wonderfully connected.\r\n\r\nZoned for the highly sought-after Kohimarama School and Selwyn College, both within easy walking distance, this is a rare opportunity to secure one of the area's most distinctive lifestyle properties.\r\n\r\nAn extraordinary sanctuary. A home to retreat, entertain and simply breathe.",
